# PrestaShop Invoice Number Formatter

A lightweight PrestaShop module to customize the displayed invoice number format.

The module replaces the default PrestaShop invoice number output with a configurable format based on:

* invoice prefix
* invoice year
* invoice number

The original invoice number stored in the database is not changed.

## Features

* Custom invoice number format
* Configurable format pattern
* Automatic year detection from the invoice date
* Supports invoice prefixes configured in PrestaShop
* Configurable minimum number length
* Works with PrestaShop invoice display
* No database changes required

## Requirements

* PrestaShop 9.x
* PHP version supported by your PrestaShop installation

## Installation

1. Copy the module folder into:

```
/modules/invoicenumberformatter
```

2. Install the module in the PrestaShop backend:

```
Modules → Module Manager → Invoice Number Formatter → Install
```

3. Open the module configuration page and set your desired format.

## Configuration

The module provides two configuration options:

### Pattern

Defines the invoice number format.

Available placeholders:

| Placeholder | Description               |
| ----------- | ------------------------- |
| `{prefix}`  | PrestaShop invoice prefix |
| `{year}`    | Two digit invoice year    |
| `{number}`  | Formatted invoice number  |

Example:

```
{prefix}{year}{number}
```

Result:

```
VTU2614
```

Another example:

```
{prefix}-{year}-{number}
```

Result:

```
VTU-26-0014
```

### Minimum number digits

Defines the minimum length of the invoice number.

Example:

```
4
```

Invoice number:

```
14
```

Result:

```
0014
```

## Year handling

The year is calculated from the invoice creation date.

Example:

Invoice date:

```
2025-02-10
```

Result:

```
VTU2514
```

Invoice date:

```
2026-07-20
```

Result:

```
VTU2614
```

This ensures that invoices remain correctly formatted even when historical invoices from previous years are displayed.

## Technical information

The module uses the PrestaShop hook:

```
actionInvoiceNumberFormatted
```

The original invoice number remains unchanged in the database.

The module only modifies the displayed formatted invoice number.

## File structure

```
invoicenumberformatter/
│
├── invoicenumberformatter.php
│
└── src/
    └── Formatter.php
```

